                <pb facs="0441" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg339"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4116/57.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The German Chargé to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >German Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Beverly
                            Farms</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-08-24"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">August 24, 1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>By instructions of my Government I have to inform you, with deep regret, that
                    Ambassador Baron Sternberg died last night at Heidelberg.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hatzfeldt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
